## 0. Namespace & what to gate on
Item namespace: **`__MOD_ID__`**. Gate on `ModList.get().isLoaded("__MOD_ID__")`.
__NAMESPACE_NOTES__ (note any split between repo/asset folders and the actual item namespace).

### The derivation fact (why we value so few items)
`RecipeFuValuator` reads vanilla recipe *types* (`minecraft:crafting_*`, `smelting`,
`stonecutting`), including modded recipes that use them — so blocks/nuggets/standard crafts
**derive**. The __CUSTOM_RECIPE_SOURCE__ recipes are a custom type it can't read, so those
outputs are the leaves we pin.

